      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْزَمُ</span></b>  as syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْنَى</span> in the prov. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَاؤُكَ</span>
